### HRMS REST API — sample requests (use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension)
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
@baseUrlV2 = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v2

### Login as admin
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

### Save the token from the login response above into this variable manually,
### or use the REST Client's response variable feature.
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### List employees (paginated, filterable, searchable, orderable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/?ordering=-salary
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Filter by department + salary range
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/?department=Engineering&salary__gte=50000
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Search employees
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/?search=Ajay
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Retrieve single employee
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/1/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Create employee
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_id": "EMP00010",
  "first_name": "Neha",
  "last_name": "Rao",
  "email": "neha.rao@example.com",
  "phone": "9998887771",
  "department_id": 1,
  "designation": "Backend Developer",
  "salary": 65000,
  "joining_date": "2024-02-01",
  "status": "active"
}

### Update employee (partial)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/employees/1/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "salary": 90000
}

### Delete employee
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/employees/2/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Bulk create
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees/bulk-create/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "employee_id": "EMP00011", "first_name": "A", "last_name": "B", "email": "a.b@example.com", "phone": "9000000001", "department_id": 1, "designation": "Intern", "salary": 20000, "joining_date": "2024-06-01", "status": "active" },
  { "employee_id": "EMP00012", "first_name": "C", "last_name": "D", "email": "c.d@example.com", "phone": "9000000002", "department_id": 1, "designation": "Intern", "salary": 20000, "joining_date": "2024-06-01", "status": "active" }
]

### Bulk update
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/employees/bulk-update/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "id": 1, "salary": 95000 },
  { "id": 3, "designation": "Senior QA Engineer" }
]

### Bulk delete
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees/bulk-delete/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ids": [5, 6] }

### Own profile (view/update)
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/profile/me/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Dashboard stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/stats/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Departments CRUD
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Audit logs (admin only, 50/page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### API v2 — richer employee data
GET {{baseUrlV2}}/employees/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Change password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_password": "Admin@12345",
  "new_password": "NewAdmin@123",
  "confirm_password": "NewAdmin@123"
}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
